UPDATE companies SET description='Iron Mountain Forge & Furniture began in 2013 as a one-woman operation in Boone, North Carolina, founded by Carley Ferrara.

The studio specializes in metal fabrication, blacksmithing, welding, and woodworking to produce custom furniture and decorative pieces. Projects range from small forged items to large-scale installations, all designed and built in-house. The team also runs hands-on forging workshops, including the popular “Sip & Smash” class, and sells a line of ready-made goods through an Etsy shop.

Clients include individual homeowners, interior designers, and commercial customers across the United States and internationally, with the company noting it ships custom pieces worldwide. The Etsy channel serves retail buyers looking for gifts and smaller accessories, while the workshop classes attract hobbyists and groups seeking a guided metalworking experience.

Ferrara’s guiding principle is that furniture should be built to last generations, not years, a philosophy reflected in the studio’s emphasis on handcrafted detail and durable construction. Her background—including a 2015 appearance on HGTV’s Ellen’s Design Challenge—underscores a commitment to design integrity that the company cites as its primary differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Metal fabrication", "Blacksmithing", "Welding", "Woodworking", "Furniture design", "Custom design", "Forging classes"], "industries": ["Custom furniture", "Metal fabrication", "Woodworking", "Blacksmithing", "Retail", "Education"], "materials": ["Metal", "Wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handmade pieces built to last generations", "Custom metal fabrication and woodworking under one roof", "Forging workshops (Sip & Smash) for individuals and groups", "Founder with 20+ years combined woodworking and blacksmithing experience", "Featured on HGTV\u2019s Ellen\u2019s Design Challenge (2015)"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2013 in Boone, NC -> /about", "Founder Carley Ferrara -> /about", "Carley Ferrara BFA Interior Design, MFA Furniture Design RISD -> /about", "Moved to Atlantic Mills, Providence, RI -> /about", "Woman-owned (single-woman operation) -> /about", "Team of 7 craftspeople plus interns -> /about", "Specializes in metal fabrication and design -> /about", "Offers forging classes (Sip & Smash) -> /", "Sells on Etsy -> /", "Featured on HGTV Ellen\u2019s Design Challenge 2015 -> /about", "Philosophy: furniture built to last generations -> /", "Attention to unique and beautiful details sets apart -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "create custom pieces for clients all over the world", "founded_year": "2013", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "owner