UPDATE companies SET description='Iron & Oak Metal Fabrication operates from New Fairfield, Connecticut. The company was founded by David DiCairano, who began his career as an ornamental ironworker in the New York City metropolitan area in 2003. After years of union experience working on custom railings, gates, decorative pieces, and large-scale stairs, DiCairano established Iron & Oak to bring that same level of craftsmanship to homeowners and small businesses.

The shop specializes in custom steel fabrication, producing one-of-a-kind pieces ranging from residential and commercial railings to custom table bases, home decor items, and ornamental gates and staircases.

Past projects have included residential stair railings, commercial entry gates, and bespoke furniture bases.

