UPDATE companies SET description='Island Pacific Energy is based in Honolulu, Hawaii, and has been serving the islands since 2007. The company was founded to provide sustainable energy solutions to homeowners and businesses across Hawaii.

The firm specializes in the design, installation, and maintenance of solar energy systems, offering turnkey services that cover permitting, approvals, and final commissioning. It has completed over 10 megawatts of clean energy installations across the Hawaiian islands and has been named a National Top Solar Contractor for 12 consecutive years. The company reports a 100% customer satisfaction rate on its projects.

Its customers include residential homeowners seeking energy independence, commercial clients such as Punahou School looking to convert energy liabilities into fixed assets, and community-scale projects. The company designs scalable microgrids for businesses and provides battery storage integration for both residential and commercial applications.

Island Pacific Energy differentiates itself through zero-down financing options, an educational sales approach, and a commitment to using only tier-1 equipment from top manufacturers. Its mission is to make clean, affordable energy accessible to everyone in Hawaii, a goal recognized by awards including the Governor''s Award for Innovation and multiple Business Leadership Hawaii honors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design", "Solar installation", "Solar maintenance", "Permitting and approvals management", "Battery storage integration", "Commercial microgrid engineering", "Zero-down financing facilitation"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Education"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Zero-down financing with payback under five years", "Turnkey design, permitting, and installation service", "Tier-1 equipment from highest-rated manufacturers", "12-time National Top Solar Contractor award", "100% customer satisfaction internal benchmark"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2007 -> /about-us", "Headquarters Honolulu, Hawaii -> db", "10+ MW clean energy systems completed -> /", "12-time National Top Solar Contractor -> /", "100% customer satisfaction rate -> /", "Turnkey design, permitting, approvals, final switch-on -> /about-us", "Zero-down financing options -> /about-us", "Tier-1 equipment from highest rated manufacturers -> /about-us", "Governor''s Award for Innovation, Business Leadership Hawaii awards, Fastest 50 award -> /about-us", "Client Punahou School (John Field, VP) -> /", "Residential and commercial solar + battery solutions -> /", "Commercial microgrid engineering -> /", "Mission: contribute to cleaner, greener future -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We specialize in the design, installation, and maintenance of solar energy systems for homes, businesses, and communities.", "fo