UPDATE companies SET description='JA Electronics Manufacturing Co is based in Stafford, Texas. The company provides custom-engineered cathodic protection solutions for the corrosion prevention industry.

The company manufactures air-cooled cathodic protection rectifiers, custom bond boxes and junction boxes, and solar-powered impressed current cathodic protection (ICCP) systems that pair Kyocera photovoltaic panels with its patented Omega II controller. It also supplies anodes (graphite, high-silicon cast iron, platinum/niobium/mixed-metal oxide coated wire), cables, backfill, and field instruments such as holiday detectors, locators, reference electrodes, and thickness testers.

Its training schools travel across the United States, offering hands-on courses in rectifier installation, design methods, maintenance, troubleshooting, and remote communications. Design consulting services are also available for optimizing cathodic protection systems.

The company highlights its Omega II bridge/controller, which delivers up to 50 amperes with 5% or less output ripple—far lower than the 45% ripple typical of standard units—thanks to fold-back voltage and output regulation. Custom enclosures, mounting options, and the ability to engineer solar-powered systems for sites without commercial power are also cited as differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cathodic protection rectifier manufacturing", "Junction box and bond box manufacturing", "Solar-powered cathodic protection system manufacturing", "Anode, cable, and backfill supply", "Corrosion monitoring instrument supply", "Cathodic protection training services", "Cathodic protection design consulting", "Rectifier installation and maintenance training", "Remote monitoring system integration", "Custom enclosure fabrication"], "industries": ["Corrosion prevention industry", "Cathodic protection industry"], "materials": ["Graphite", "High silicon cast iron", "Platinum-coated wire", "Niobium-coated wire", "Mixed-metal oxide coated wire", "Cables", "Backfill", "Kyocera photovoltaic panels"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Patented Omega II controller with \u22645% output ripple (vs 45% on standard units)", "Solar-powered CP systems using Kyocera panels for off-grid sites", "Custom rectifier enclosures, mounting, and instrumentation options", "Design consulting backed by advisors active since 1980", "Nationwide hands-on training schools for CP installation and maintenance"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Stafford, Texas -> db", "Business description: cathodic protection solutions custom engineered -> db", "Products: air-cooled rectifiers, junction boxes, solar CP units, anodes, cables, backfill, instruments -> /", "Services: training schools, design consulting -> /services", "Design team advising since 1980 -> /services", "Omega II controller specs: up to 50A, \u22645% ripple -> /", "So