UPDATE companies SET description='JC Barger Custom Wood Furniture operates from Kimberly, Idaho, where Josh and Christiana Harshbarger established the family-run business nearly three decades ago. The couple built the company on a passion for craftsmanship and a desire to work closely with family and friends, and they continue to lead the boutique operation today.

The shop produces artisan conference tables and custom furniture pieces, each bench-made using masterful joinery techniques and finished with proprietary in-house blended stains applied by hand. The team offers signature and custom design concepts, creative solutions, and artist renditions, guiding clients from initial sketch through production.

The company regularly delivers to markets such as Sun Valley, Boise, Salt Lake City, Park City, Jackson Hole, and Lake Tahoe, and has shipped as far as Australia. Realtors like Jordan Beard reference the firm for custom installations, while hospitality clients seek durable, distinctive tables that anchor dining spaces.

