UPDATE companies SET description='Jordan''s Furniture operates a location at the Warwick Mall in Warwick, Rhode Island, one of eight stores the chain maintains across New England. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed in the available information.

The Warwick store sells a range of name-brand furniture and mattresses for living rooms, bedrooms, dining rooms, home offices, and children''s rooms. It includes a Factory Outlet section offering first-quality pieces at reduced prices, as well as a Sleep Lab equipped with BridgeIT technology that matches customers to mattresses. Additional services include custom closet design and installation through Closettec.

The store serves residential customers throughout the Rhode Island area, drawing shoppers seeking furniture, mattresses, home accents, area rugs, and entertainment furniture.

