UPDATE companies SET description='KNEXTEC LLC was founded in 2010 by Wayne Shafer in Las Vegas, Nevada. Virginia Shafer joined as co-founder, and the company established its manufacturing headquarters in Las Vegas with a second production site in Tijuana, Baja California, Mexico.

The company specializes in custom cable assembly and wire harness manufacturing, including design, prototyping, and low-volume production. All products undergo 100% individual testing to IPC-A-610, IPC-7711/7721, and IPC/WHMA-A-620 Revision C standards.

