UPDATE companies SET description='Kastlfel is based in Lakewood, Colorado. The company was founded with a mission to create sustainable apparel through a lifecycle approach, though the founding year and founders are not publicly disclosed.

Kastlfel controls the entire manufacturing process from fiber to finish, employing environmentally conscious screen printing and low-impact certified dyes and finishes.

Kastlfel serves both direct consumers and wholesale buyers through its Kastlfel Wholesale channel, targeting the sustainable apparel and promotional products markets. Its customer base includes brands and organizations seeking verified sustainable garments with transparent supply chains.

