UPDATE companies SET description='KC Exotic Woodworks LLC operates from Kansas City, Kansas, providing building and refinishing services backed by quality workmanship. The company offers a broad portfolio of custom woodwork and related crafts.

The workshop produces custom furniture, cabinetry, epoxy resin products, doors, windows, leather goods, and cutting boards. Core processes include woodworking, furniture refinishing, antique restoration, cabinet building and refinishing, epoxy casting for river tables and art, laser engraving, and leather tooling. Materials range from locally harvested hardwoods such as oak, cherry, maple, and walnut to exotic slabs, natural stone, and a full line of epoxy resins for woodworking, casting, and flooring applications.

The company serves residential and commercial clients in the Kansas City area, including homeowners remodeling kitchens, bathrooms, and basements, as well as businesses seeking custom fixtures. They also supply epoxy resins and materials to woodworking hobbyists, resin artists, knife makers, blacksmiths, and flooring professionals. Partnerships with local sawmills and enterprises support material sourcing.

KC Exotic Woodworks differentiates itself through a commitment to craftsmanship and personalized design. The team highlights its strong relationships with local sawmills to secure premium materials, its ability to match custom stains and finishes, and its in-house epoxy resin inventory that supports both production and retail sales. Antique restoration work focuses on preserving historical character while integrating modern functionality.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture building", "Furniture refinishing", "Antique furniture restoration", "Cabinet building", "Cabinet refinishing", "Epoxy resin casting", "Epoxy river table fabrication", "Custom door and window fabrication", "Leather tooling", "Laser engraving", "Custom cutting board production", "Custom stain matching", "Wood vanity fabrication", "Single-slab island fabrication", "Art frame fabrication", "Art restoration", "Epoxy resin supply (retail)"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Furniture manufacturing", "Woodworking", "Art restoration", "Knife making", "Blacksmithing", "Flooring", "Leather goods"], "materials": ["Oak", "Cherry", "Maple", "Walnut", "Exotic wood slabs", "Locally harvested hardwoods", "Locally harvested softwoods", "Granite", "Marble", "Quartz", "Onyx", "Ceramic", "Natural stone", "Slate", "Concrete", "Epoxy resins (woodworking, casting, quick-setting, structural, flooring)", "Leather"], "equipment": ["Pressure pots for epoxy resin casting", "Laser engraving equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Strong partnerships with local sawmills for premium material access", "Custom stain matching and finish expertise", "In-house epoxy resin inventory for woodworking, art, and flooring", "Antique restoration preserving original character with modern upgrades", "Combined woodworking and leather tooling capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Company name: KC Exotic Woodworks LLC -> db", "Headqu