UPDATE companies SET description='Kendall Packaging Corporation operates from Jefferson, Wisconsin, as a privately held manufacturer of flexible packaging.

The company produces flexible packaging structures including cold-seal films, eco-friendly films, and high-barrier laminations for moisture, oxygen, and light protection. Its two mirror-operation facilities run identical equipment and raw materials, enabling redundancy and consistent quality. Real-time monitoring covers raw material receiving through final shipment.

Kendall serves food producers, brand owners, and retailers, with its FSSC 22000 certification (GFSI recognized) qualifying it for major retail supply chains. Customers range from small food manufacturers undergoing first co-packer audits to established brands managing multi-site supplier risk. Applications include heat-sensitive products and shelf-life-critical packaging.

The company emphasizes a continuous-improvement culture where every employee is trained to flag issues early, paired with third-party verified food safety systems. Its differentiators include dual-certified facilities, solventless adhesive technology to reduce energy and solvent use, and a customer-focused model offering agile solutions and dedicated support teams.', certifications=ARRAY['FSSC 22000','GFSI recognized']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Flexible packaging manufacturing", "Cold seal packaging", "High-speed processing", "Heat-sensitive product packaging", "Premium graphics printing", "Barrier protection (moisture, oxygen, light)", "Sustainable packaging solutions", "Eco-friendly film production", "Solventless adhesive lamination", "Recycling programs", "Real-time quality monitoring", "Continuous improvement programs", "Packaging design", "Packaging technology development"], "industries": ["Food and beverage packaging", "Retail packaging", "Brand owners", "Co-packers"], "materials": ["Flexible films", "Eco-friendly films", "Solventless adhesives"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["FSSC 22000 certification at both manufacturing facilities", "Mirror-operation facilities providing production redundancy", "Real-time quality monitoring across all production lines", "Solventless adhesive applications reducing energy and solvent consumption", "Eco-friendly films delivering premium barrier performance"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Jefferson, Wisconsin -> db", "Privately held ownership -> /", "Operates two mirror-operation manufacturing facilities -> /quality", "FSSC 22000 certified at both locations -> /quality", "GFSI recognized certification -> /quality", "Produces flexible packaging including cold seal and eco-friendly films -> /", "Offers premium graphics and barrier protection -> /", "Uses solventless adhesive applications -> /", "Real-time quality monitoring of raw materials, production, finished products -> /quality", "Serves food producers, brand owners, retailers -> /quality", "Establishes comprehensive recycling programs -> /", "Focus on sustainable packaging -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "both of our manufacturing facilities hold this certification", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='kendall-packaging-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
