UPDATE companies SET description='L & B Electronics operates from Eldon, Missouri, where it provides two-way radio communications sales and service alongside storm warning siren solutions. The company serves customers across Missouri, Oklahoma, and Kansas for siren installations, while offering nationwide mail-in repair and sales for radio and siren controller equipment.

